PECR where marketing is involved</td><td>Same as message content</td><td>FireText; AI providers; hosting</td><td>Possible</td><td>Conversation retention; delivery logs 12 months</td></tr><tr><td>Payments and subscriptions</td><td>Take payment, manage access, accounting</td><td>Customers</td><td>Stripe and GoCardless customer, mandate, checkout, payment, plan, amount and status identifiers; limited billing data</td><td>Contract; legal obligation</td><td>Not intended</td><td>Stripe; GoCardless; accountants; tax authorities where required</td><td>Possible</td><td>Financial records 6 years after financial year</td></tr><tr><td>Safety classification and flags</td><td>Prevent harm, safeguarding and unlawful acts</td><td>Users / mentioned people</td><td>Message references, category, severity, excerpt, response, status</td><td>Legitimate interests; vital interests where applicable</td><td>DPA 2018 Schedule 1 paras 10 and/or 18; legal claims; vital interests</td><td>Authorised staff; hosting; legal/emergency authorities if necessary</td><td>Only if lawful disclosure requires</td><td>False positive 12 months; ordinary flags 24 months; serious case 6 years</td></tr><tr><td>HQ human review</td><td>Safeguarding, complaints, support, sampled quality assurance</td><td>Users</td><td>Pseudonymous chat, media, flags, relationship indicators, audit data</td><td>Legitimate interests for ordinary data; contract for support</td><td>Explicit consent for optional sensitive QA; Schedule 1 conditions for safeguarding</td><td>Senior reviewers only</td><td>No new transfer intended</td><td>Review records 3 years; serious cases 6 years</td></tr><tr><td>Identity access</td><td>Identify a member where genuinely necessary</td><td>Users</td><td>Name, email, phone and account identifiers</td><td>Legitimate interests / legal obligation / vital interests depending purpose</td><td>Same condition as underlying case</td><td>HQ Directors / approved senior reviewers</td><td>No new transfer intended</td><td>Identity request/audit 6 years</td></tr><tr><td>Security and fraud</td><td>Protect accounts, systems and payments</td><td>Users, staff, attackers</td><td>IP, user-agent, login, rate-limit and audit events</td><td>Legitimate interests; recognised legitimate interest where applicable</td><td>May incidentally contain sensitive data</td><td>Hosting, security providers, law enforcement if necessary</td><td>Possible</td><td>12 months normally; 6 years for substantiated incident</td></tr><tr><td>Support, rights and complaints</td><td>Resolve issues and meet legal duties</td><td>Users / complainants</td><td>Identity/contact, correspondence, evidence and outcome</td><td>Contract; legal obligation; legitimate interests</td><td>Explicit consent or legal-claims/safeguarding condition as relevant</td><td>Authorised staff, advisers, ICO</td><td>Possible if advisers/providers abroad</td><td>3 years after closure; legal hold if required</td></tr><tr><td>Age assurance</td><td>Prevent children accessing adult content</td><td>Users seeking adult features</td><td>Age-assurance result/token, method, timestamp; no ID copy retained by Engram unless strictly necessary</td><td>Legal obligation / legitimate interests</td><td>Not intended; vendor may process identity data under its own safeguards</td><td>Age-assurance provider [TO COMPLETE]</td><td>Possible</td><td>Active account + 12 months; provider period to verify</td></tr><tr><td>Marketing and analytics</td><td>Communications and site improvement</td><td>Visitors/users</td><td>Contact details, preferences, cookie/device data</td><td>Consent where required by PECR; legitimate interests for limited necessary analytics</td><td>Do not use special-category chat data for marketing</td><td>Email/analytics providers [TO COMPLETE]</td><td>Possible</td><td>Consent record 6 years; analytics per cookie schedule</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
